From 7fed726f2d8569173da9f39a1302ef0d23fa9bd7 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Sungtak Lee <taklee@google.com>
Date: Tue, 1 Oct 2024 04:02:03 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 094/436] C2HIDL: handle unregistered death notification

HIDL HAL unregister death notification permaturely certain cases.
Handle cleaning up even though death notification is not received.

Bug: 309898317
Test: build
Flag: EXEMPT bugfix

Change-Id: I36e1b19fc7d716e007d3f4418536bfcb0c98837a
---
